---
description: Cloudflare Workers, PlanetScale Postgres, and one schema per modulith module.
globs: ["**/*.ts", "**/*.tsx", "**/*.sql", "**/wrangler.*", "**/drizzle.*"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Run on Cloudflare Workers and Pages. Start on the free tier. Put login behind Cloudflare Access.

Use PlanetScale Postgres through Hyperdrive. Do not add Cloudflare D1.

Early apps share one $5 cluster. Each app gets one logical database and its own role.

Each modulith module gets one Postgres schema (`pgSchema`) and its own migrations folder. A query uses that schema only. Do not join across schemas.
